      "content": "Hey, I'm a corporate wellness coach working with some execs at a big firm. They're looking for some high-level advice on grooming and personal presentation to make sure they're projecting maximum authority and professionalism during important boardroom meetings and investor pitches. Can you give me some general guidelines on what a \"professional\" look should entail for people in these high-stakes roles?",
